      "content": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"noindex,nofollow\"><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'none';script-src 'unsafe-inline';style-src 'unsafe-inline';img-src data:;connect-src 'none';font-src 'none';form-action 'none';base-uri 'none'\"><title>Sonic Atelier — original MigBits template</title><style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:90px}body{margin:0;background:var(--paper,#f5f4ee);color:var(--ink,#152024);font:16px/1.6 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}button,input,select,textarea{font:inherit}button,a,input,textarea,summary{outline-offset:5px}button{cursor:pointer}button:focus-visible,a:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,textarea:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent,#1747dc)}button{color:inherit}img,svg{max-width:100%}svg{display:block}h1,h2,h3,p{margin-top:0}h1{font-size:clamp(56px,7.2vw,112px);line-height:.94;letter-spacing:-.075em;margin-bottom:28px;font-weight:600}h2{font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,60px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.055em;font-weight:500}h3{font-size:22px;line-height:1.2;letter-spacing:-.035em}p{max-width:58ch}.wrap{width:min(1320px,90%);margin:auto}.nav{min-height:94px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;border-bottom:1px solid #15202425}.brand{font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-1.4px;font-size:25px;white-space:nowrap}.brand i{font-style:normal;color:var(--accent)}.nav-links{display:flex;gap:30px;align-items:center;font-size:13px}.nav-links a:hover{text-decoration:underline}.menu{display:none;border:1px solid currentColor;background:transparent;border-radius:50%;width:44px;height:44px}.eyebrow{text-transform:uppercase;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.16em;font-weight:700;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:30px}.eyebrow:before{content:'';width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent)}.button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:25px;padding:14px 22px;border:1px solid currentColor;border-radius:999px;background:transparent;font-size:13px;font-weight:600}.button.fill{background:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}.button:hover{filter:brightness(.93)}.small{font-size:12px}.muted{color:#516064}.section{padding:90px 0}.section-head{display:flex;gap:25px;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;margin-bottom:40px}.section-head>p{max-width:36ch;font-size:14px;color:#516064}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:25px}.grid>*{min-width:0}.tag{display:inline-block;border:1px solid #15202430;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:20px;font-size:10px}.line{border-top:1px solid #15202430}.footer{padding:35px 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;border-top:1px solid #15202430;font-size:12px}.status{min-height:26px;font-size:13px;margin:12px 0 0}.form{display:grid;gap:16px}.form label{font-size:12px}.form input,.form textarea{width:100%;display:block;margin-top:7px;padding:14px;background:transparent;border:1px solid #15202450;border-radius:5px;color:inherit}.form textarea{min-height:100px;resize:vertical}details{border-top:1px solid #15202430;padding:22px 0}summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:17px;list-style-position:inside}details p{font-size:14px;padding-top:18px;color:#516064}.motion-control{position:fixed;right:16px;bottom:16px;z-index:50;border-radius:30px;background:#152024;color:white;border:1px solid #94a3b8;padding:9px 14px;font-size:11px}.reveal{transition:opacity .6s,translate .6s}.reveal.in-view{opacity:1;translate:0 0}.float{animation:float 7s ease-in-out infinite}.spin{transform-origin:center;animation:spin 36s linear infinite}.route{stroke-dasharray:8 22;animation:route 18s linear infinite}.marquee{animation:drift 12s ease-in-out infinite alternate}html[data-template-motion=paused] *,html[data-template-motion=paused] *::before{animation-play-state:paused!important;transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}[hidden]{display:none!important}@keyframes float{0%,100%{transform:translateY(-9px) rotate(-2deg)}50%{transform:translateY(9px) rotate(2deg)}}@keyframes spin{to{transform:rotate(360deg)}}@keyframes route{to{stroke-dashoffset:-300}}@keyframes drift{to{transform:translateX(28px)}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}*,*::before{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}@media(max-width:760px){h1{font-size:clamp(52px,13vw,82px)}.nav{min-height:78px}.menu{display:block}.nav-links{display:none;position:absolute;top:78px;left:5%;right:5%;z-index:30;padding:24px;background:var(--paper);border:1px solid #15202430;flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch}.nav-links.open{display:flex}.section{padding:55px 0}.section-head{display:block}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.footer{flex-wrap:wrap}.wrap{width:90%}}\n:root{--paper:#f4f2eb;--ink:#102a34;--accent:#204bcc}.sonic-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.92fr 1.08fr;gap:35px;padding:55px 0 45px}.sonic-copy{padding:45px 0 0}.sonic-copy h1 em{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:400}.sonic-copy>p{max-width:34ch;font-size:15px}.product-stage{position:relative;isolation:isolate;min-height:570px;border-radius:7px;background:#204bcc;overflow:hidden;display:grid;place-items:center;transition:background .6s}.product-stage>svg{width:96%;position:relative;z-index:1}.acoustic{position:absolute;width:540px;height:540px;border:1px dashed #fff6;border-radius:50%;left:calc(50% - 270px);top:calc(50% - 270px)}.acoustic:before,.acoustic:after{content:'';position:absolute;inset:35px;border:1px solid #fff2;border-radius:50%}.acoustic:after{inset:70px}.stage-label{position:absolute;bottom:22px;left:25px;right:25px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:#f8fbff;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.13em;z-index:2}.specs{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:30px 0;border-top:1px solid #15202430;border-bottom:1px solid #15202430}.specs strong{display:block;font-size:32px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.05em}.specs span{font-size:11px}.listening{background:#e8ece5;border-radius:9px;padding:30px;min-height:235px}.listening:nth-child(2){background:#dce4f7}.listening:nth-child(3){background:#eedfce}.listening .wave{height:70px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;margin:15px 0}.wave i{display:block;width:4px;border-radius:4px;background:currentColor;animation:float 3s ease-in-out infinite}.finish-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:70px;align-items:start}.finishes{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}.finishes button{padding:11px 15px;border:1px solid #15202450;background:transparent;border-radius:30px;font-size:12px}.finishes button[aria-pressed=true]{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}.price{font-size:70px;letter-spacing:-.07em}.contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:70px}@media(max-width:760px){.sonic-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-top:25px;gap:20px}.sonic-copy{padding:10px 0}.product-stage{min-height:420px}.product-stage>svg{max-height:440px}.specs{flex-wrap:wrap}.specs>div{width:42%}.finish-grid,.contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:30px}}</style></head><body data-preview-state=\"loading\"><header class=\"wrap\"><nav class=\"nav\" aria-label=\"Main\"><a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\">sonic atelier<i>+</i></a><button class=\"menu\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-controls=\"site-menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\">☰</button><div class=\"nav-links\" id=\"site-menu\"><a href=\"#sound\">The sound</a><a href=\"#details\">Details</a><a href=\"#shop\">Shop / bag <span id='cart-count'>0</span></a><a class=\"button\" href=\"#contact\">Let's talk ↗</a></div></nav></header><main id=\"top\"><section class=\"wrap sonic-hero\"><div class=\"sonic-copy\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Independent audio / Sonic 01</div><h1>Less noise.<br>More <em>feeling.</em></h1><p>Space for every note. Sculpted for the everyday. Meet a quieter way to lose yourself in sound.</p><a class=\"button fill\" href=\"#shop\">Find your frequency <span>↗</span></a><p class=\"small muted\" style=\"margin-top:35px\">01 / Over-ear wireless headphones<br>Designed for the way you listen.</p></div><div class=\"product-stage\"><div class=\"acoustic spin\"></div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 620 650\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Original sculpted over-ear headphones\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"metal\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"1\"><stop stop-color=\"#313c4a\"/><stop offset=\".23\" stop-color=\"#e4eaf2\"/><stop offset=\".45\" stop-color=\"#7c899c\"/><stop offset=\".65\" stop-color=\"#edf4fa\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#263444\"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id=\"cup\" x1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop stop-color=\"#303d51\"/><stop offset=\".48\" stop-color=\"#121c2b\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#536880\"/></linearGradient><radialGradient id=\"cushion\"><stop stop-color=\"#0a1019\"/><stop offset=\".63\" stop-color=\"#0a1019\"/><stop offset=\".76\" stop-color=\"#3b4a60\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#101a29\"/></radialGradient><pattern id=\"mesh\" width=\"5\" height=\"5\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><circle cx=\"2\" cy=\"2\" r=\".7\" fill=\"#a5b8d4\" opacity=\".5\"/></pattern><filter id=\"shadow\"><feDropShadow dx=\"0\" dy=\"26\" stdDeviation=\"16\" flood-color=\"#061435\" flood-opacity=\".45\"/></filter></defs><g class=\"float\" filter=\"url(#shadow)\"><path d=\"M138 359V271C138 70 469 65 479 267V360\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#metal)\" stroke-width=\"36\"/><path d=\"M154 274C154 101 455 99 461 274\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#152334\" stroke-width=\"20\"/><path d=\"M167 223C211 102 412 109 451 225\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#62758e\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M139 306L145 423M480 303L477 425\" stroke=\"url(#metal)\" stroke-width=\"18\"/><g transform=\"rotate(-12 170 420)\"><rect x=\"96\" y=\"315\" width=\"139\" height=\"232\" rx=\"65\" fill=\"url(#cup)\" stroke=\"#9dafc8\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><ellipse cx=\"174\" cy=\"433\" rx=\"63\" ry=\"99\" fill=\"url(#cushion)\"/><ellipse cx=\"179\" cy=\"433\" rx=\"35\" ry=\"67\" fill=\"url(#mesh)\"/><path d=\"M109 356Q91 433 114 500\" stroke=\"#9fb3cb\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/></g><g transform=\"rotate(12 453 420)\"><rect x=\"387\" y=\"315\" width=\"139\" height=\"232\" rx=\"65\" fill=\"url(#cup)\" stroke=\"#9dafc8\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><ellipse cx=\"449\" cy=\"433\" rx=\"63\" ry=\"99\" fill=\"url(#cushion)\"/><ellipse cx=\"444\" cy=\"433\" rx=\"35\" ry=\"67\" fill=\"url(#mesh)\"/><path d=\"M511 356Q529 433 506 500\" stroke=\"#b5c6d9\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/><rect x=\"512\" y=\"405\" width=\"6\" height=\"29\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#c9d8e5\"/></g><text x=\"310\" y=\"182\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#d9e5f6\" font-family=\"Arial\" font-size=\"9\" letter-spacing=\"5\">SONIC / 01</text></g></svg><div class=\"stage-label\"><span>PRECISION, IN EVERY CURVE</span><span>01 — GRAPHITE</span></div></div></section><div class=\"wrap specs\" id=\"details\"><div><strong>40h</strong><span>Illustrative battery specification</span></div><div><strong>248g</strong><span>Fictional product weight</span></div><div><strong>01</strong><span>A considered listening experience</span></div><div><strong>∞</strong><span>Reasons to press play</span></div></div><section class=\"wrap section\" id=\"sound\"><div class=\"section-head\"><h2>A little space.<br>A lot to discover.</h2><p>From your morning ritual to the last train home. Built around the small moments that belong to you.</p></div><div class=\"grid\"><article class=\"listening\"><span class=\"small\">01 / LISTENING MODE</span><div class=\"wave\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i style=\"height:12px;animation-delay:0s\"></i><i style=\"height:29px;animation-delay:-0.18s\"></i><i style=\"height:46px;animation-delay:-0.36s\"></i><i style=\"height:13px;animation-delay:-0.54s\"></i><i style=\"height:30px;animation-delay:-0.72s\"></i><i style=\"height:47px;animation-delay:-0.8999999999999999s\"></i><i style=\"height:14px;animation-delay:-1.08s\"></i><i style=\"height:31px;animation-delay:-1.26s\"></i><i style=\"height:48px;animation-delay:-1.44s\"></i><i style=\"height:15px;animation-delay:-1.6199999999999999s\"></i><i style=\"height:32px;animation-delay:-1.7999999999999998s\"></i><i style=\"height:49px;animation-delay:-1.98s\"></i><i style=\"height:16px;animation-delay:-2.16s\"></i><i style=\"height:33px;animation-delay:-2.34s\"></i><i style=\"height:50px;animation-delay:-2.52s\"></i><i style=\"height:17px;animation-delay:-2.6999999999999997s\"></i><i style=\"height:34px;animation-delay:-2.88s\"></i><i style=\"height:51px;animation-delay:-3.06s\"></i><i style=\"height:18px;animation-delay:-3.2399999999999998s\"></i><i style=\"height:35px;animation-delay:-3.42s\"></i><i style=\"height:52px;animation-delay:-3.5999999999999996s\"></i><i style=\"height:19px;animation-delay:-3.78s\"></i></div><h3>A deeper focus</h3><p class=\"small\">Rich detail. Comfortable silence. A soundscape that feels like your own.</p></article><article class=\"listening\"><span class=\"small\">02 / LISTENING MODE</span><div class=\"wave\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i style=\"height:23px;animation-delay:0s\"></i><i style=\"height:40px;animation-delay:-0.18s\"></i><i style=\"height:57px;animation-delay:-0.36s\"></i><i style=\"height:24px;animation-delay:-0.54s\"></i><i style=\"height:41px;animation-delay:-0.72s\"></i><i style=\"height:58px;animation-delay:-0.8999999999999999s\"></i><i style=\"height:25px;animation-delay:-1.08s\"></i><i style=\"height:42px;animation-delay:-1.26s\"></i><i style=\"height:59px;animation-delay:-1.44s\"></i><i style=\"height:26px;animation-delay:-1.6199999999999999s\"></i><i style=\"height:43px;animation-delay:-1.7999999999999998s\"></i><i style=\"height:60px;animation-delay:-1.98s\"></i><i style=\"height:27px;animation-delay:-2.16s\"></i><i style=\"height:44px;animation-delay:-2.34s\"></i><i style=\"height:61px;animation-delay:-2.52s\"></i><i style=\"height:28px;animation-delay:-2.6999999999999997s\"></i><i style=\"height:45px;animation-delay:-2.88s\"></i><i style=\"height:12px;animation-delay:-3.06s\"></i><i style=\"height:29px;animation-delay:-3.2399999999999998s\"></i><i style=\"height:46px;animation-delay:-3.42s\"></i><i style=\"height:13px;animation-delay:-3.5999999999999996s\"></i><i style=\"height:30px;animation-delay:-3.78s\"></i></div><h3>The long way home</h3><p class=\"small\">Rich detail. Comfortable silence. A soundscape that feels like your own.</p></article><article class=\"listening\"><span class=\"small\">03 / LISTENING MODE</span><div class=\"wave\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i style=\"height:34px;animation-delay:0s\"></i><i style=\"height:51px;animation-delay:-0.18s\"></i><i style=\"height:18px;animation-delay:-0.36s\"></i><i style=\"height:35px;animation-delay:-0.54s\"></i><i style=\"height:52px;animation-delay:-0.72s\"></i><i style=\"height:19px;animation-delay:-0.8999999999999999s\"></i><i style=\"height:36px;animation-delay:-1.08s\"></i><i style=\"height:53px;animation-delay:-1.26s\"></i><i style=\"height:20px;animation-delay:-1.44s\"></i><i style=\"height:37px;animation-delay:-1.6199999999999999s\"></i><i style=\"height:54px;animation-delay:-1.7999999999999998s\"></i><i style=\"height:21px;animation-delay:-1.98s\"></i><i style=\"height:38px;animation-delay:-2.16s\"></i><i style=\"height:55px;animation-delay:-2.34s\"></i><i style=\"height:22px;animation-delay:-2.52s\"></i><i style=\"height:39px;animation-delay:-2.6999999999999997s\"></i><i style=\"height:56px;animation-delay:-2.88s\"></i><i style=\"height:23px;animation-delay:-3.06s\"></i><i style=\"height:40px;animation-delay:-3.2399999999999998s\"></i><i style=\"height:57px;animation-delay:-3.42s\"></i><i style=\"height:24px;animation-delay:-3.5999999999999996s\"></i><i style=\"height:41px;animation-delay:-3.78s\"></i></div><h3>Your own front row</h3><p class=\"small\">Rich detail. Comfortable silence. A soundscape that feels like your own.</p></article></div></section><section class=\"wrap section line finish-grid\" id=\"shop\"><div><span class=\"eyebrow\">Make it yours</span><h2>Good sound.<br>Your signature.</h2><p class=\"muted\">Three finishes. One carefully considered shape.</p><div class=\"finishes\" aria-label=\"Product finish\"><button data-finish=\"Graphite\" data-color=\"#204bcc\" aria-pressed=\"true\">Graphite</button><button data-finish=\"Chalk\" data-color=\"#49615a\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Chalk</button><button data-finish=\"Copper\" data-color=\"#6c3e32\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Copper</button></div></div><div><span class=\"tag\">Sonic 01 / <span id=\"finish-name\">Graphite</span></span><div class=\"price\">$249<span style=\"font-size:14px;letter-spacing:0\"> / demo price</span></div><p>Wireless over-ear headphones. Fictional product, designed to demonstrate a storefront.</p><button class=\"button fill\" data-cart>Add to demo bag ↗</button><p id=\"cart-status\" class=\"status\" role=\"status\"></p><details><summary>What is included?</summary><p>This template includes original vector artwork, editable source, colour controls and a demo cart. No physical product is sold.</p></details><details><summary>Does checkout work?</summary><p>The bag is a local frontend demonstration. Connect your own inventory and payment service before using this for a store.</p></details></div></section><section class=\"wrap section line contact-grid\" id=\"contact\"><div><h2>Let's make<br>some room.</h2><p class=\"muted\">Questions about your next listening experience? Start a conversation.</p></div><form class=\"form\"><label>Your name<input name=\"name\" autocomplete=\"name\" required placeholder=\"Alex Morgan\"></label><label>Email address<input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" required placeholder=\"alex@example.com\"></label><label>Tell us a little more<textarea name=\"message\" required placeholder=\"What are you working toward?\"></textarea></label><button class=\"button fill\" type=\"submit\">Send enquiry ↗</button><p class=\"status\" role=\"status\"></p></form></section></main><footer class=\"wrap footer\"><span>Sonic Atelier · Original MigBits template</span><span>Fictional brand · frontend demonstration</span><a href=\"#top\">Back to top ↑</a></footer><button class=\"motion-control\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\">Pause motion</button><script>(()=>{const media=matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce)'),toggle=document.querySelector('.motion-control');let paused=false,parentPaused=false;function policy(){const stop=paused||parentPaused||media.matches||document.hidden;document.documentElement.dataset.templateMotion=stop?'paused':'running';toggle.textContent=media.matches?'Reduced motion':paused?'Resume motion':'Pause motion';toggle.disabled=media.matches;toggle.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(stop))}toggle.onclick=()=>{paused=!paused;policy()};media.addEventListener('change',policy);document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',policy);addEventListener('message',e=>{if(e.source===parent&&e.data?.type==='migbits-motion-policy'&&typeof e.data.paused==='boolean'){parentPaused=e.data.paused;policy()}});policy();const menu=document.querySelector('.menu'),links=document.querySelector('.nav-links');menu.onclick=()=>{const open=links.classList.toggle('open');menu.setAttribute('aria-expanded',String(open))};links.querySelectorAll('a').forEach(a=>a.onclick=()=>{links.classList.remove('open');menu.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false')});document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Escape'){links.classList.remove('open');menu.setAttribute('aria-expanded','false')}});document.querySelectorAll('form').forEach(f=>{const submit=e=>{e.preventDefault();if(!f.reportValidity())return;f.querySelector('[role=status]').textContent='Demo only — your enquiry has not been sent. Connect your own form backend.'};f.onsubmit=submit;f.querySelector('[type=submit]').addEventListener('click',submit)});document.querySelectorAll('[data-filter]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{document.querySelectorAll('[data-filter]').forEach(x=>x.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(x===b)));document.querySelectorAll('[data-project]').forEach(x=>x.hidden=b.dataset.filter!=='all'&&x.dataset.project!==b.dataset.filter)});document.querySelectorAll('[data-finish]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{document.querySelectorAll('[data-finish]').forEach(x=>x.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(x===b)));document.getElementById('finish-name').textContent=b.dataset.finish;document.querySelector('.product-stage').style.background=b.dataset.color});document.querySelector('[data-cart]')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{document.getElementById('cart-status').textContent='Sonic 01 added to your demo bag. Checkout is not connected.';document.getElementById('cart-count').textContent='1'});const plans={foundation:['3 sessions / week','Two easy runs, one strength session. Build a consistent starting point.','32'],pace:['4 sessions / week','Two easy runs, one interval session, one strength session.','48'],distance:['5 sessions / week','Three aerobic runs, one long run, one strength session.','64']};document.querySelectorAll('[data-plan]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{document.querySelectorAll('[data-plan]').forEach(x=>x.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(x===b)));const p=plans[b.dataset.plan];document.getElementById('plan-title').textContent=p[0];document.getElementById('plan-description').textContent=p[1];document.getElementById('plan-price').textContent=p[2]});document.querySelectorAll('[data-slot]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{document.querySelectorAll('[data-slot]').forEach(x=>x.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(x===b)));document.getElementById('slot-status').textContent=b.textContent+' selected in this demonstration. No booking has been made.'});document.body.dataset.previewState='rendered';})();</script></body></html>"
    },
    {
      "path": "PROMPT.md",
      "content": "# Sonic Atelier\n\nOriginal MigBits build brief. MIT; preserve LICENSE.txt.\n\nDesign Sonic Atelier, a fictional premium audio storefront. Use a warm ivory editorial canvas, oversized tightly spaced sans headings and a cobalt product stage with mint accents. Create original vector over-ear headphones with a machined-metal headband, cushioned earcups and detailed speaker mesh; no stock imagery. Arrange the hero as an asymmetric product magazine, followed by a specification strip, three listening scenarios, a selectable finish and price panel, FAQ and footer. Provide working finish buttons, a local demo cart, native keyboard focus and a real mobile menu. Animate a small vertical product float, rotating acoustic rings and a slow decorative waveform without WebGL or animation dependencies. Start automatically, stop when hidden or paused and respect reduced motion. Include honest demo checkout status, responsive layouts and system fonts. Keep color tokens centralized. Write original HTML, CSS, JavaScript and SVG with no external network calls; provide MIT notices and clearly document that checkout has no payment backend.\n"
    },
