    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Sonic Atelier\n\nAn immersive audio storefront with sculpted vector headphones, finish selection, a local cart and editorial product storytelling.\n\nExtract the ZIP and open index.html. No package installation or network connection is needed.\n\nPROMPT.md is an original MigBits build brief. Use it to extend or rebuild the design in your preferred framework.\n\nAll names, products, prices and booking times are fictional examples. Forms and cart actions have no backend.\n\nKeep LICENSE.txt when modifying, distributing or selling copies. Review the final accessibility and connect your own services before production use.\n\nUse the template colour selector and copy the resulting CSS after the original stylesheet. Original vector artwork and source remain separate from that adaptation.\n\nhttps://github.com/rakshithp1/migbits/blob/main/resources/library/original-showcases.ts\n"
    },
